    "summary": "Round gourd transformed into a storage-vessel (a), &#039;boursa&#039;, and separate lid (b). The low neck of the vessel is formed out of plaited vegetable fibre and leather thongs stitched around a hole cut in the top of the gourd. The lid is a section cut from the top of the gourd, with the addition of a raised rim, also made out of plaited vegetable fibre and leather thongs. Several cracks in the base of the gourd have been locally repaired using vegetable fibre stitching.",
